{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《World Flags and Geography》是一款結合遊戲與學習的地理工具，透過測驗考驗玩家對世界各國國旗、地理位置及首都的認識，適合地理科教師與學生使用。此應用程式原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-68.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>國旗地理首都趣味測驗</h2>\n<p>此應用程式既是遊戲，也是學習工具，透過測驗考驗你對世界各國國旗、地理位置及首都的認識。作答期間，你可以逐步熟悉各地國旗外觀、國家位置和首都名稱，適合地理科教師與學生邊玩邊學，在遊戲中鞏固世界地理知識。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-308-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-309-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-310-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-311-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-312-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-313-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：World Flags and Geography</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/world-flags-and-geography/id721350453?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:54:45.422964+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:37:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T23:18:38.880958+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:51:43.104955+00:00","content_hash":"1c7bdd7da2061ec6a595cb38db2b6b4303696639cd5a48f050b8fa12596e1bf2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}